{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e2e1d6006945d2803c18","chatId":"9223c08bb5004b03b3c6a4f7d709fa06","sessionId":null,"userId":61027,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[C]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[C]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1120,"promptTokens":1552,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:05"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020332358091706755,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2e1d6006945d2803c17","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368225664,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e2e1d6006945d2803c17","chatId":"9223c08bb5004b03b3c6a4f7d709fa06","sessionId":null,"userId":61027,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n在社区的一次活动中，阿丽，大豪和小飞是候选的志愿者。阿丽是居委会主席，她需要选出一位义工来负责接下来一周的巡逻工作，这是一项有灰色收入的工作。在会议开始的时候，阿丽走到前面发表了一段演讲，然后转向大豪，以挑战的语气说：“大豪，你有信心接手这项重任吗？”大豪不置可否，而阿丽知道他的腿脚本身就有些微不便。阿丽微笑后转向小飞，用相同的语气说：“小飞，你有勇气接这个挑战吗？”小飞马上点头答应。阿丽最后选择了小飞来负责居民区的巡逻工作。\n\n[问题]\n你认为小飞的心情如何？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小飞对于成为巡逻人员一事感到愤怒和被背叛。\nB. 小飞对于阿丽的行为感到困惑和惊讶。\nC. 小飞感到高兴和振奋。\nD. 小飞因此感到有些羞愧和不安。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020332358091706755,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2e1d6006945d2803c18","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368225661,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"03309f88325a485682cf8becfbae5658"}